      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PortfolioSnapshot\n(BC7)\n\nRiskBudgetSnapshot\n(BC6, 30ms fail-closed)\n\nPrecedent nodes\n(EvidenceGraph, pg 17)\n\nShared correlation /\ncluster model\n(co-owned with BC6,\nnever forked)\n\nFORBIDDEN\nCannot call BC6's\nauthorisation internals.\nCannot reach BC8.\nCannot touch a filled\nposition. No signing key.\n\nSLO\nrebalance() < 300ms p99",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PortfolioSnapshot\n(BC7)\n\nRiskBudgetSnapshot\n(BC6, 30ms fail-closed)\n\nPrecedent nodes\n(EvidenceGraph, pg 17)\n\nShared correlation /\ncluster model\n(co-owned with BC6,\nnever forked)\n\nFORBIDDEN\nCannot call BC6's\nauthorisation internals.\nCannot reach BC8.\nCannot touch a filled\nposition. No signing key.\n\nSLO\nrebalance() < 300ms p99",
